# U-Boot environment (A/B boot state) for fw_printenv / fw_setenv.
# Must match uboot.fragment: redundant, 64 KiB copies at 1 MiB and 1 MiB + 64 KiB
# on the system disk, outside any partition. /dev/rsos-disk is the disk the
# system booted from (rcS links it: the microSD, or the Pro's eMMC once
# RetroStoneOS is installed there); U-Boot keeps its environment on the disk
# it started from too.
# Device	Offset		Size
/dev/rsos-disk	0x100000	0x10000
/dev/rsos-disk	0x110000	0x10000
